  "body": [
    "Register for Fall Programming! Session runs now - Nov 8.",
    "PLAY PLAY submenu Programs Private Lessons Adult Camps Summer Camps Book a Court Free30 Dave Bailey Programs",
    "EVENTS EVENTS submenu Calendar 2026 BNP Paribas World Team Cup",
    "ABOUT ABOUT submenu Meet Our Team Contact Us Sponsors & Partners USTA National Campus Scholarship",
    "WATCH WATCH submenu Watch Live Record Your Match",
    "VISIT VISIT submenu Hotel Booking Sustainability Health & Wellness Shop",
    "Home >",
    "Play",
    "Explore our endless play opportunities and unleash your tennis potential in our state-of-the-art facility.",
    "Our play opportunities are open to players of all levels and interests, designed to make tennis easier to learn and more inclusive.",
    "Let's Tennis!",
    "Pickleball is a versatile and low-impact sport played with a plastic, perforated ball that is known for its accessibility and health benefits.",
    "Learn More",
    "Merging elements of tennis, racquetball, and squash, Padel is a fast-paced sport that is easy to learn but hard to master!",
    "Learn More",
    "Unlock your potential with private and personalized instruction from our certified coaches.",
    "Learn More",
    "Dave Bailey's footwork program integrates agility drills, plyometrics, and tennis-specific movements to enhance speed, coordination, and overall athletic performance.",
    "Learn More",
    "Immerse yourself in our state-of-the-art facility with our multiple- or single-day camps, designed to elevate your game and connect you with other players.",
    "View Camps",
    "Playing the game is just as important for your development as practice!",
    "Join Now",
    "The USTA National Campus is a Safe Play compliant facility, upholding the Safe Play Policy.",
    "Monday - Friday 7:00 AM - 9:00 PM",
    "Saturday 7:00 AM - 5:00 PM",
    "Sunday 7:00 AM - 5:00 PM",
